# GitHub Actions CI/CD Pipeline CODEOWNERS
# 
# This file defines code ownership for release approvals.
# Release workflows require approval from designated maintainers.
#
# Maintainers must approve changes to:
# - Release workflow configuration
# - Homebrew tap formula updates
# - Package manager publications
#
# Learn more: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Release workflow requires approval from project maintainer
/.github/workflows/release.yml @sirkirby

# Build workflow changes should be reviewed
/.github/workflows/build.yml @sirkirby

# PR validation workflow changes should be reviewed
/.github/workflows/pr-validation.yml @sirkirby

# All workflow files require maintainer review
/.github/workflows/ @sirkirby
